	// shutdown/crash can cause these gaps to become permanent.
	//
	// We don't truncate ahead of gaps at > initIndex, and wait for them to be
	// filled. This makes an invariant that only an entire prefix is truncated,
	// and allows more efficient Pebble scans that skip over tombstones.
